## Third-party data

The dataset used by this project — **IBM AMLSim Example Dataset** — is
licensed under the **Apache License 2.0** and is **not** included in this
repository. It is fetched on demand by `scripts/fetch_data.py`.

The dataset is derived from the [IBM AMLSim](https://github.com/IBM/AMLSim)
project, which is intended to provide a multi-agent based simulator that
generates synthetic banking transaction data together with a set of known
money laundering patterns — mainly for the purpose of testing machine
learning models and graph algorithms.
